IndigoPlateau_Interior4_Text_Lorelei_1::
	.string "{PLAY_BGM MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}I am KAREN of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "You’re {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "How amusing.\p"
	.string "I love dark-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I find their wild tough image to be\n"
	.string "so appealing. And they’re so strong.\p"
	.string "Think you can take them? Just try to\n"
	.string "entertain me.\p"
	.string "Let’s go.$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior4_Text_Lorelei_2::
	.string "Strong POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Weak POKéMON.\p"
	.string "That is only the selfish perception\n"
	.string "of people.\p"
	.string "Truly skilled trainers should\n"
	.string "try to win with their favorites.\p"
	.string "I like your style.\n"
	.string "You understand what’s important.\p"
	.string "Go on--the CHAMPION is waiting.$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior4_Text_LoreleiDefeat::
	.string "Well, aren’t you good. I like that\n"
	.string "in a trainer."
